:: Carter Bedroom Watch TV Cuddle [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 30>>
As the next cartoon comes on, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> decides to mix it up a little for one reason or another. Instead of relaxing on his beanbag, he moves it to the side and just lies flat on the ground, glancing up at the screen as his feet slip under his bed. You ask him why he decided to lie on the ground rather than the beanbag and he just shrugs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I dunno.”</span> Which is really all the explanation the boy needs to give. <br>

